        },
        "text_37BRNF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Product Description</p>",
            "class": "sn-uppercase"
          }
        },
        "text_dLtfq9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>What makes this the <em>right</em> build?</h2><p>This bundle pairs the Laon Swingcraft VTrack — an overhead, camera-based launch monitor with dual high-speed stereoscopic cameras — with everything needed to build a finished, permanent simulator bay at home or in a private studio. The Eagle 12 enclosure creates a dedicated 12-foot hitting bay with safe ball containment and a clean, room-within-a-room aesthetic.</p><p>The BenQ AK700ST brings true 4K Ultra HD projection designed specifically for golf simulation — sharper image quality, cleaner text overlays, and more vivid course rendering. A BenQ projector mount, QCast wireless dongle, and a 25-foot cable kit (power + HDMI) are included to support real-world ceiling installs with clean cable routing.</p><p>The Elite ProTee 5x10 hitting mat and 6x12 landing mat complete the floor, giving you a large, durable stance area and a polished bay feel. A VTrack impact protector and a dozen TaylorMade TP5 Pix balls mean you're ready to swing from day one.</p><p>The VTrack requires a minimum ceiling height of 106 inches and is compatible with GSPro, E6 Connect, and E6 Apex. No marked balls or club stickers required for core use.</p>",
            "class": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
